node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# TypeScript's incremental cache. `**/dist` is excluded but this was not, so a
# developer's local build state was copied into the image, where tsc trusted it,
# decided everything was already emitted and skipped the build — exiting 0 while
# `deleteOutDir` had just removed dist. The image then shipped with no main.js
# and the container crash-looped. Build inputs must not include host state.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.github
backups
storage
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
